@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:5_2
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_35_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:集合到会客厅的少女共有11位。<br>每个人都略显尴尬地回避着其他人的视线。|#0101Adv24_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:站在艾玛身旁的是<br>雪莉和梅露露。|#0101Adv24_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL7
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR4,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，你没事吧？<br>看你现在好像随时会昏倒的样子……|#0101Adv24_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:还、还是在沙发上坐着会比较好……|#0101Adv24_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:对于陷入这种状况也还在关心她的二位，<br>艾玛努力挤出了一个笑容。|#0101Adv24_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我没事的。震惊的不只有我，<br>大家肯定也一样……|#0101Adv24_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:除了凶手之外。|#0101Adv24_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆息を呑む

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0101Adv24_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……我们之中有杀害诺亚的凶手？<br>　怎么可能呢）|#0101Adv24_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的视线摇摆不定，<br>想要悄悄观察大家的反应。|#0101Adv24_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所有人都脸色苍白，<br>满脸写着难以置信。|#0101Adv24_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么可能，会有凶手……|#0101Adv24_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的自言自语有些苍白无力。|#0101Adv24_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [sfx 8：フクロウの羽ばたき音]
; ========================================

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，随着天花板边上传来一阵翅膀拍动的声音，<br>典狱长现身了。|#0101Adv24_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:唉……结果还是<br>发生了凶杀案……|#0101Adv24_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:今晚，将会举行【魔女审判】。|#0101Adv24_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:请各位务必从在押囚犯当中锁定杀人凶手的身份。<br>选中的人将以【魔女】的身份被处以死刑。|#0101Adv24_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们会用特殊方法行刑，<br>令不会轻易死亡的魔女永久地安息。<br>那会是非常……非常残酷的方法。|#0101Adv24_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:另外，有件事要向全体囚犯通告。<br>如果没有选出凶手，将会对所有人处刑。|#0101Adv24_Warden005| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:听到典狱长轻松说出十分可怕的宣言，<br>少女们开始躁动起来。|#0101Adv24_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然我很不想增加无谓的工作，<br>不过各位本来就是<br>以危险分子的身份囚禁在此……|#0101Adv24_Warden006| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只是……主人说……不对，<br>总之呢，以我们监牢管理方的感受而言，<br>要是全员处死就太可怜了。|#0101Adv24_Warden007| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以呢，各位一定要<br>选出一位【魔女】，<br>只把【魔女】做掉就好了。|#0101Adv24_Warden008| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:说到底，只有在<br>无法选定【魔女】的情况下<br>才会触发全员处死的规定。|#0101Adv24_Warden009| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:请各位努力找到凶手哦……<br>只要找到凶手，就能活下来……<br>哎，总之，大家乐观一点享受当下的状况吧。|#0101Adv24_Warden010| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，还有，为了避免搜查期间有人做手脚，<br>请大家不要随意触碰遗体。<br>现场也请保持原状不动。|#0101Adv24_Warden011| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那么，就拜托大家进行搜查了。<br>啊！不过搜查也挺难的，大家不要勉强自己哦……<br>搞不懂的话，各位只要去死就好了……|#0101Adv24_Warden012| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:搜查期限到魔女审判开庭广播为止。<br>只要我还没下班，视乎我的心情，也会回答各位的提问……<br>或许吧。|#0101Adv24_Warden013| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [sfx 8：フクロウの羽ばたき音]
; ========================================

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长结束了自说自话后<br>便离开了。|#0101Adv24_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful1

[PrintTextModified Text:必须要在审判中选一个人去死。<br>艾玛感到自己全身手脚冰凉。|#0101Adv24_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（如果不能在今天之内找到凶手，就要全体处死……？<br>　时间也太不够用了！）|#0101Adv24_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（而且，我不愿意相信<br>　我们之中竟有人行凶杀人！）|#0101Adv24_Ema006|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（可是，诺亚确实是被人杀死的……<br>　太过分了……无法原谅……）|#0101Adv24_Ema007|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:会客厅充斥着一股尴尬的沉默。|#0101Adv24_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:像是在猜测他人的想法一样，<br>每个人的视线都游离不定。|#0101Adv24_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:少女们度过的共同生活仅仅数日。|#0101Adv24_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:正如玛格所说，<br>大家对彼此都不甚熟悉。|#0101Adv24_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:要在这种情况下互相信任，<br>真的是非常，非常困难。|#0101Adv24_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1,ArmR1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:之后，蕾雅站在室内正中心。<br>所有人的目光集中在她身上。|#0101Adv24_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:发生这样的事，我真的很难受……<br>但，我想要找出凶手。|#0101Adv24_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR5,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:我同意。<br>我也不想蒙冤被判死刑。|#0101Adv24_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这起凶杀案的凶手，<br>应当以【魔女】的身份老实接受惩罚。|#0101Adv24_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，我相信大家都是这个想法。<br>没多少时间了，我们分头去搜查吧。|#0101Adv24_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅和玛格二人<br>正准备离开。|#0101Adv24_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛慌张了起来。|#0101Adv24_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:等、等一下，蕾雅！<br>只要知道谁是凶手，就要把她送上处刑台吗！？|#0101Adv24_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅从艾玛身边走过。<br>她的脸因难受扭作一团。|#0101Adv24_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

