[PrintTextModified Text:这是为了帮助大家。<br>而且我心里已经有了可疑人选。|#0101Adv24_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……！？|#0101Adv24_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到蕾雅的话后，<br>艾玛惊得呆住了。|#0101Adv24_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Ema Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:此时蕾雅的眼神，<br>指向了汉娜。|#0101Adv24_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1,ArmR3,ArmL1 SubId:ForeFront

[PrintTextModified Text:远野汉娜。<br>——你就是杀害了城崎诺亚的凶手，对不对？|#0101Adv24_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Ema Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:什么……|#0101Adv24_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1 SubId:ForeFront

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然我还没仔细调查，<br>但是现场没有留下足迹。|#0101Adv24_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也就是说……只有拥有飘浮魔法的人<br>才有办法作案，我没说错吧？|#0101Adv24_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Hanna Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜她不可能是凶手！|#0101Adv24_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Ema Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL1 SubId:ForeFront

[PrintTextModified Text:……你如果是这么想的话，就去搜查吧。<br>我今晚会让一切水落石出。|#0101Adv24_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:MainBackground-ForeFront Loop:false ScenePositionY:36 EasingTypeName:EaseOutQuad Duration:0.5
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Leia-ForeFront Loop:false ScenePositionY:22 EasingTypeName:EaseOutQuad Duration:0.5
@HideActors ActorIds:MainBackground-ForeFront,Leia-ForeFront Lazy:false
