[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅一脸阴沉地走出了会客厅。|#0101Adv24_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（因为想帮助大家，她必须要选某个人做魔女……<br>　所以蕾雅她也变得相当冷酷……）|#0101Adv24_Ema011|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（虽然我懂她的想法，可是，我怎么可以怀疑汉娜！）|#0101Adv24_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可、奈叶香、亚里沙三人<br>也各自走出了会客厅。|#0101Adv24_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安坐在沙发上，梅露露一脸担心地<br>坐在她的身旁。|#0101Adv24_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:那，我就带安安小姐去医务室了。<br>以安安小姐现在的情况，她根本没法参加搜查……|#0101Adv24_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Fearful1,Angle01/Option_Arms-

[PrintTextModified Text:安安是第一个发现诺亚的尸体的人。<br>事情造成的冲击太大，她现在脸色煞白，身体还在不断颤抖着。|#0101Adv24_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊……希望你可以好好照顾她。|#0101Adv24_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露搀扶着安安走出去了。|#0101Adv24_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:留在原地的只剩<br>艾玛、雪莉和汉娜三人。|#0101Adv24_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜正低头咬着嘴唇。<br>她似乎相当难受，两只眼睛都是湿乎乎的。|#0101Adv24_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜……|#0101Adv24_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR15,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:是时候该侦探出马了！<br>我们一起去找到真凶，洗刷汉娜的冤屈吧！|#0101Adv24_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉充满干劲地说道。<br>艾玛受到感染，表情也变得缓和些了。|#0101Adv24_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:对、对啊，汉娜才不是凶手。<br>绝对不能让她被处刑！|#0101Adv24_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2

[PrintTextModified Text:就靠我们找出真凶吧！|#0101Adv24_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……说得对，一定要找到凶手。|#0101Adv24_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:几乎要哭出来的汉娜，<br>也终于抬起了头。|#0101Adv24_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛她们乘着这股气势，<br>开始参与城崎诺亚遇害一案的搜查。|#0101Adv24_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

